    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d785">

                <pb facs="1061" n="951" xml:id="pg951"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.6731/103: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-05-07T17:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 7, 1928—5
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:30 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>67. Referring to the Department’s telegram 37, April 13, 6 p.m., section
                        5,<anchor n="24" xml:id="d785-f1"/> and my telegram 63, April 29 [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">28?</hi>], 11 a.m.</p>
                <p>The Foreign Office has informally submitted a draft text recommended for use in
                    exchange of notes prolonging commercial <hi rendition="#italic">modus
                        vivendi</hi>. This text is identical with the note dated July 20, 1926,
                    signed by Admiral Bristol,<anchor n="25" xml:id="d785-f2"/> enclosed with the
                    Embassy’s despatch 2008, July 30, 1926,<anchor n="26" xml:id="d785-f3"/> with
                    the following exceptions:<anchor n="27" xml:id="d785-f4"/></p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>Department may wish to consider whether the following clause from the second of
                    the two notes exchanged on February 17, 1927,<anchor n="28" xml:id="d785-f5"/>
                    should be inserted in line 2 in French: “Pending the coming into effect of the
                    commercial convention referred to in subparagraph (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >a</hi>) of paragraph (2) of the notes exchanged today (on February 17,
                    1927) concerning the relations between the United States and Turkey or.”</p>
                <p>Please instruct.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
